    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "bd908485-01da-3dd1-a5e8-86ded13e2591",
                "word": "jumbo",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3112e25b-9cfe-3826-a417-0b01f58cfa57",
                        "entry_id": "bd908485-01da-3dd1-a5e8-86ded13e2591",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Especially large or powerful."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8af72a87-2934-40ce-b373-a0766c7b5de2",
                                "sense_id": "3112e25b-9cfe-3826-a417-0b01f58cfa57",
                                "text": "At Bucyrus, Ohio, M. C. Coulter this season has demonstrated that he can grow a nice crop of the jumbo variety of peanuts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "691d11dd-8a6f-454e-bc74-606f7718797b",
                                "sense_id": "3112e25b-9cfe-3826-a417-0b01f58cfa57",
                                "text": "Of the receipts of unshelled peanuts only a few extras are now being bought, the remainder being divided rather equally between jumbo and fancy grades."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "399569aa-f50a-4a21-90ad-adb6d9909dcb",
                                "sense_id": "3112e25b-9cfe-3826-a417-0b01f58cfa57",
                                "text": "Not only did Jumbo-mania make [Phineas Taylor] Barnum a jumbo profit, but the word \"jumbo\" entered the English language."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee001aed-644c-4269-b858-ddeb1ded4242",
                                "sense_id": "3112e25b-9cfe-3826-a417-0b01f58cfa57",
                                "text": "As the number of judges on an appellate court increases, the court evolves into what I call a \"jumbo court.\" First, the dynamics of a jumbo court are such that, as the court grows larger, the productivity of individual judges on the court declines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba8524e5-5c5a-44a8-b12f-f159e3648011",
                                "sense_id": "3112e25b-9cfe-3826-a417-0b01f58cfa57",
                                "text": "As the name suggests, jumbo frames are frames with a larger size compared to the standard MTU [maximum transmission unit]. Sending data in jumbo frames means there are fewer frames sent through the network, resulting in fewer IRQs [interrupt requests] at the receiving end. This obviously generates big improvements in terms of bandwidth and CPU [central processing unit] cycles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
