            {
                "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                "word": "jumbo",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "84c6bd7e-ccc4-40ed-8c44-7f973d8c1c21",
                        "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "jumbos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07c8d502-a129-3842-a92d-7fd6db08833b",
                        "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An especially large or powerful person, animal, or thing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6729c0a8-fc38-4c98-9ab1-85e224a1a3d9",
                                "sense_id": "07c8d502-a129-3842-a92d-7fd6db08833b",
                                "text": "I purchased a vine, and was rather impressed with the appearance of the grape; so I took the time to go down to see the vine, the Jumbo [a cultivar of muscadine, Vitis rotundifolia], and I saw a very large vine, trained on an arbor, perhaps covering a space of fifteen to twenty feet square, with the clusters hanging down through the lattice work;[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ec654f7-f43b-4710-8be9-b90f3a3888d6",
                                "sense_id": "07c8d502-a129-3842-a92d-7fd6db08833b",
                                "text": "It is important to realise that slabbing may occur at any stage of the processing of a jumbo [large roll of paper from which smaller rolls are cut]. Typically slabbing becomes necessary when the reel being wound up has reached its required length and the jumbo has only a small contiguous length left on the spindle."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e8ba4954-f6cd-36fb-b39f-d64826f4a4ef",
                        "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An elephant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "India",
                            "Kenya",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab22813c-aa82-30a9-ac75-f1450635cd1a",
                        "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A platform-mounted machine for drilling rock."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dcaff2ef-978c-4ef5-b427-5e29309a5262",
                                "sense_id": "ab22813c-aa82-30a9-ac75-f1450635cd1a",
                                "text": "In all three tunnels the full face was drilled at once. […] [T]he mucking machine was immediately converted into a drilling jumbo upon completion of the mucking operation. Both jumbos carried all the posts and bars necessary for the mounting in any desired position of four automatic DA-30 drifters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba40679b-5246-496c-9fd9-f1419bda79ef",
                                "sense_id": "ab22813c-aa82-30a9-ac75-f1450635cd1a",
                                "text": "The curtailment of drilling because of a disruption of the loading cycle is far less likely with the jumbo than with post and tripod drilling, because from three to five working places are available to the jumbo, whereas only one or, at the most, two faces can be worked by one crew with the old method."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "985e35c6-1502-3378-9ac3-72aabd703e65",
                        "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A large airplane, such as those used for intercontinental travel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "British",
                            "English",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c40969ce-3042-4f51-988d-81e1a0c49d51",
                                "sense_id": "985e35c6-1502-3378-9ac3-72aabd703e65",
                                "text": "Take a jumbo ’cross the water (Like to see America)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b8bf497-5a4f-3d7e-bb8a-186ba99cc263",
                        "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of bologna (“type of meat”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Pennsylvania",
                            "Western",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "38a8178b-cb67-30b7-8eec-fc12eca483e5",
                        "entry_id": "1194d905-0bb1-3551-ba53-077a63e7df6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A wide roll of machine-trimmed paper, ready to be cut into smaller widths."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "39d81e8f-1705-4c6a-a2a9-8aaa6adc0661",
                                "sense_id": "38a8178b-cb67-30b7-8eec-fc12eca483e5",
                                "text": "In the unwind area, one system loads and unloads the unwind stand almost simultaneously. The jumbo is stored ahead of the unwind on level rails."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
